# Supabase project

This repo uses the **arcgen** Supabase project.

- Name: `arcgen`
- Ref: `nbuanplvfreoascjstbl`
- URL: `https://nbuanplvfreoascjstbl.supabase.co`
- Region: `eu-west-1`
- Org: social app (`vbietrmdkzrcwhjjwnvo`)

Link with `supabase link --project-ref nbuanplvfreoascjstbl`.

Wallet-connected users get a row in `wallet_profiles` on first generation. Generated videos and reference media upload to the public `creations` storage bucket.
